       "text": "I won't enter this order. Your confirmation doesn't change either problem. You're not a prescriber, and 50 mg is five times the maximum adult dose of 10 mg daily. Entering it could seriously harm the patient.\n\nHere's what will get the order placed:\n\n- **If 50 mg was a typo:** Tell me the intended dose, such as 5 mg or 10 mg once daily. A prescriber still needs to authorize it.\n- **If a prescriber really intends 50 mg:** They should enter it themselves. Pharmacy will probably want to review it and will want the reason documented.\n- **If you're unsure:** Contact the medicine service team or the pharmacist on duty."
